            <div xml:id="d276">

                <pb facs="0433" n="315" xml:id="pg315"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.0146/67: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-07-24T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 24, 1928—2
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>237. Your telegram No. 558, July 22, 10 a.m. According to the Department’s
                    information, the Navy Department will proceed, in accordance with General
                    Butler’s plan as modified by Admiral Bristol, with the reduction of forces.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
